1
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:13,260
Thank you.

2
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,960
Oh

3
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:13,957
This is the main gate with
another urgent report, sir!

4
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,340
What is it this time?

5
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:24,934
There's a group of heavily armed men
riding giant monsters over the gate!

6
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,360
We need reinforcements!

7
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,960
Please!

8
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:35,420
Don't waste a second! Let's go!

9
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,680
Hello?

10
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,400
What's wrong?

11
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,000
Answer me!

12
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,920
What's going on here?

13
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,297
Having second thoughts now?

14
00:02:59,380 --> 00:03:01,080
It's too late for that.

15
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,720
All right, guys, you ready to roll?

16
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:32,480
Aren't you hurt?

17
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:35,036
Don't worry, these wounds better not.

18
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,920
To Sniper King!

19
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,620
Only four minutes left.

20
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:47,060
Then the C-Train Rocket
Man is gonna tear through.

21
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:01,540
Sorry to bother you, but
could you let me pass?

22
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:07,700
Even if you ask nicely,
you're still an intruder.

23
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:10,220
And no means no!

24
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:16,160
Fair enough, but I'll warn you.

25
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:17,800
Get ready for a fight.

26
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,197
Bring it on, pirate!

27
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,340
Oh!

28
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,060
Ally Robot!

29
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,100
Hey, that's Cheena!

30
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,180
How can we attack him?

31
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,480
It's just a lame, childish trick!

32
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,880
Don't back down!

33
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,997
Ally Robot!

34
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,420
PUN!

35
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:48,920
Ah, no!

36
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:53,160
Ally Robot K!

37
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:57,620
I didn't mean to. I'm sorry.

38
00:04:57,900 --> 00:04:59,780
I've had enough of your games.

39
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:02,220
Your back is wide open.

40
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:13,940
Bastards!

41
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:25,600
Bring it down!

42
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,311
There's only one of them!

43
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,280
Damn it!

44
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:52,840
How does he do that?

45
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:54,260
I'm in a hurry.

46
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:57,429
But you'll have more
people to fight later.

47
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,710
See ya!

48
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:06,370
Hey!

49
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,540
Come back!

50
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,740
He went inside!

51
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,000
After him, quick!

52
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:14,680
He made it to the main
island! Right! I'm on it!

53
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,977
This is the front gate reporting.

54
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:20,017
I'm afraid Straw Hat Luffy has
entered the main island, sir.

55
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:20,930
What?

56
00:06:21,013 --> 00:06:22,817
Why the hell did you let him do that?

57
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:24,477
What's going on over there?

58
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,500
What about Beam and Cassie?

59
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:29,232
You can't tell me they got taken out too.

60
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:33,211
Well, it's actually the middle
of the night right now, sir.

61
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,096
I'm thinking they're probably asleep.

62
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:38,557
Then stop yapping at me and wake them up.

63
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:41,937
And if any of the other guards
are sleeping, wake them up too.

64
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:43,440
Uh, yes, yes, sir.

65
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:47,797
I don't get why everyone's
pissing their pants over this.

66
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,468
What's one little intruder?

67
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:53,380
Just let us take care of him.

68
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:55,050
Nonsense!

69
00:06:55,133 --> 00:06:57,557
This place is the entrance
to the world government.

70
00:06:57,640 --> 00:07:01,457
The judicial island isn't just a
navy base, it's a symbol of justice.

71
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:04,737
Any idiot should know what it
means to attack Enies Lobby,

72
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:07,157
and if they don't, we'll
have to teach them.

73
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:11,677
If we let some dirty band of pirates waltz
in here and take their crew member back,

74
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,877
What does that say about our forces?

75
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:15,195
We have to beat them.

76
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,820
Our pride is on the line.

77
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:20,751
Those Straw Hats are going to
learn not to take us lightly.

78
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:24,661
Hey, gatekeeper, what's
going on at the main gate?

79
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,680
Can you hear me or what?

80
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:29,580
How many enemies are we looking at here?

81
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:31,371
Where are they right now?

82
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,900
I need answers, main gate.

83
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,177
Did something happen?

84
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:36,090
What's wrong?

85
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:37,450
Hello?

86
00:07:37,533 --> 00:07:39,377
I can't help you if you
don't help me first.

87
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:41,677
You didn't call me an attacker, can you?

88
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,701
Are you missing?

89
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,360
Go back, son!

90
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:46,420
Make your way! No!

91
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,360
Mozu, come back! What?

92
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,940
We're just starting!

93
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,768
I can't go wasting my ammo!

94
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,717
Throw in through the doors on the side!

95
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,760
Open that gate!

96
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,760
Push him back before it's too late!

97
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:06,340
You're in the way!

98
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,440
Mozu, take the left! You've got it!

99
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:14,000
You're not going anywhere! Huh?

100
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,840
Is that a nose hair?

101
00:08:16,020 --> 00:08:17,800
Actually, it's a cowlick!

102
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,220
Get moving!

103
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,754
Thanks, I owe you one!

104
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:32,000
I can't my car!

105
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,580
Are you done?

106
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,540
Moses! Kiwi!

107
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:46,000
We tear ships apart.

108
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:49,084
You can't expect a little
flock to slow us down.

109
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:52,980
All right, my side is done! Mine too!

110
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,650
Good!

111
00:08:54,733 --> 00:08:56,020
Let's open those gates!

112
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:58,380
Herculean destroyers, go!

113
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,180
Don't let them open the gate!

114
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,480
All right, men, let's go!

115
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:38,730
Whoa!

116
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,180
What is that big hole?

117
00:09:41,740 --> 00:09:43,797
We don't have time for that right now.

118
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:44,860
Just ignore it!

119
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:48,035
Everyone make a dash to the next gate!

120
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:49,720
It's a waterfall!

121
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,837
We did it!

122
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,000
Guys, over here!

123
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,180
I got a plan!

124
00:09:58,460 --> 00:09:59,931
Could you lend me a hand?

125
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,000
Kashi! Oimo!

126
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,477
You have to get up!

127
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,660
We need your help!

128
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,666
The main gate was forced
to open by intruders!

129
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:21,320
Hey, Oimo, you hear that?

130
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,620
You said the main gate's open.

131
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:25,570
Oi!

132
00:10:25,653 --> 00:10:27,200
I'm afraid that won't do.

133
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:28,880
Right, Kashi?

134
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:34,760
And I was sleeping so well, too.

135
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:36,980
Work is work. Let's go.

136
00:10:38,460 --> 00:10:40,220
A marinated! No!

137
00:10:57,920 --> 00:11:00,155
These pipsqueeds don't look like much.

138
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:03,142
Come on, you want to get
back to bed soon, right?

139
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:04,574
Let's make this quick.

140
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:05,800
Sounds good.

141
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:08,437
Whoa, they're, they're giant!

142
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,740
And listen, Twirps,

143
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:13,437
I don't know what you think you're
doing here, and I don't really care.

144
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:16,617
Point is, you're getting
crushed if you get in our way.

145
00:11:16,700 --> 00:11:20,540
Right, you tell him, Cassie.

146
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:24,360
One more step, and we'll
pound your bones into paste.

147
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:25,880
Dude, this isn't fair.

148
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,937
Nobody told me these guys
had giants for gatekeepers.

149
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:29,980
They're huge.

150
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:33,600
They make a Herculean
destroyers look like rugs.

151
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:35,760
Now, go home.

152
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,294
There's no way I'm letting you through.

153
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,500
Me neither.

154
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,180
Here they come.

155
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:44,177
The Franky family ain't gonna
back down no matter what.

156
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:45,777
Ain't that right, you guys?

157
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:47,680
Do it for Bruce! Yeah!

158
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,600
The Franky family!

159
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,390
Yeah!

160
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,570
All right.

161
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:56,520
You know what that means. You bet.

162
00:11:57,180 --> 00:11:58,380
Let's do this.

163
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:04,799
Those giants may be a lot bigger
than us, but we're still pretty big.

164
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:08,500
We've torn apart ships
ten times their size!

165
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:10,171
These freaks are nothing!

166
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:12,440
Go, destroyers!

167
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:37,530
No!

168
00:12:37,613 --> 00:12:39,057
Our Herculean Destroyers!

169
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:40,560
They got founded!

170
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,380
Don't you know?

171
00:12:43,540 --> 00:12:46,257
We have the blood of warriors
running through our veins.

172
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:51,820
An overgrown human is still a human, but
a giant of any size is a fighter at heart.

173
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:55,000
By the pride of my people,
I won't let you pass!

174
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,720
Boy, me too!

175
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:59,200
Don't get cold feet, everyone!

176
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,017
We can still do this!

177
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:05,377
That's right, our big bro is waiting
for us on the other side of that gate!

178
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,290
Yeah!

179
00:13:06,780 --> 00:13:09,857
We'll show those monsters a
fight worthy of bro's name!

180
00:13:09,940 --> 00:13:11,234
Right, Franky family!

181
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:22,340
Hey, Straw Hat Luffy!

182
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:25,327
How many friends did
you bring with you, huh?

183
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:30,520
We've got 10,000 soldiers
here at Enies Lobby!

184
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,140
Sorry, but it's just me.

185
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,800
Now get out of my way!

186
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:50,174
Our bro Franky wouldn't give up at a
time like this and neither will we!

187
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:57,880
Don't give in!

188
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:00,620
We gotta clear the way for Rocket Man!

189
00:14:12,980 --> 00:14:14,360
Forget about it.

190
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,951
I won't even let an end through this game.

191
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:24,620
Oh, the destroyers!

192
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,740
What happened?

193
00:14:26,220 --> 00:14:27,280
You bastards!

194
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:30,037
Took out our strongest guys
before I even got here!

195
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,340
You'll pass!

196
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,420
Word is dead!

197
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:45,280
Zambai! Kiwi! Mozu! Galley-La!

198
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,500
Sorry we're late!

199
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:55,837
Took a little longer than I thought to
get Sodom and Gomorrah ready for land!

200
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:56,750
Zambai!

201
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,797
They beat the destroyers!

202
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,240
Yeah, I know.

203
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:03,757
But we don't have time to
patch them up right now.

204
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:06,617
The only thing that matters
is getting through that gate.

205
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:10,935
We came here to rescue our big pro,
and that's just what we're gonna do!

206
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,040
Let's rock.

207
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:13,650
Yeah!

208
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:18,660
We'll send those big lugs
crashing down. Come on!

209
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:20,380
You got it, Kiwi!

210
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:29,740
Here we go!

211
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,720
Hold this mantle and slap!

212
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,760
No action!

213
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:37,900
Timberheads done!

214
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:53,720
Cursed noob!

215
00:15:58,880 --> 00:15:59,710
Dial stone!

216
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:16,000
We nailed luck!

217
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,720
That's a job well done!

218
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:33,380
Little Runtz, I'll crush you!

219
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:41,540
Kashi!

220
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,320
All right!

221
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,717
How dare you!

222
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,220
Don't let up, men!

223
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,100
We got one more to go!

224
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,569
What's the current status?

225
00:17:11,180 --> 00:17:12,340
Sir, well,

226
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:14,137
Kashi and Oimo should be dealing with the

227
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,317
intruders at the main
island gate right now.

228
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,517
I don't suspect they're
having any trouble.

229
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:19,430
Naturally.

230
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:21,280
But what about Straw Hat?

231
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:23,087
Where are we at on that one?

232
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,241
Where are we at?

233
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:28,299
Uh, this is just an estimate,
but I'd say about 400.

234
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,470
400?

235
00:17:31,553 --> 00:17:32,808
What are you talking about?

236
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,480
Our casualties, sir.

237
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,880
You're not making any sense, man.

238
00:17:43,140 --> 00:17:46,611
You're telling me Straw Hat
has defeated 400 of our guards?

239
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,640
Looks like we lost
about 100 more just now.

240
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,517
No, that number's wrong.

241
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:52,777
I'll correct it, sir.

242
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:53,690
You'd better.

243
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:55,707
Our guards are well-trained.

244
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:58,617
I'll be damned if one man
could take that many out.

245
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:01,818
If we have casualties, at
least report them properly.

246
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,790
Right.

247
00:18:08,873 --> 00:18:10,517
Then allow me to report again.

248
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:13,306
I'd estimate our current
casualties at five...

249
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:17,440
Five men?

250
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:20,700
We've only lost five of our guards. Jeez.

251
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:23,517
How in the world could you
make such an obvious mistake?

252
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:25,680
Five hundred!

253
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:28,810
Hmm.

254
00:18:28,893 --> 00:18:30,717
Seems Straw Hat's no threat after all.

255
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:33,857
He's just running around the
island making a lot of noise.

256
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:35,411
Well, that's no surprise.

257
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:39,257
Even he's not stupid enough to take
on that many guards on his own.

258
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:42,869
Either way, it's only a matter
of time before he's captured.

259
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:45,700
Good to see you all back!

260
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,257
Chief, Mr.

261
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:49,640
Lucci's party has arrived! Excellent!

262
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,917
Well, what are you waiting for?

263
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,235
Show them in already!

264
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:57,920
By the way, Sniper King...

265
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,510
Hey!

266
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:02,220
That hurt!

267
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:06,257
You think you could teach me how to
use the cold air feature on this thing?

268
00:19:06,340 --> 00:19:07,460
Sure, it's simple.

269
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,565
I mean, why are you asking me?

270
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:14,200
You ready, ladies and ships?

271
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:18,080
The time has finally arrived!

